	(text "Nothing resistive hangs on the node after the shunts: its current would be measured.\nC801 is the only capacitor there (C0G, 100 nF). No gate-to-source resistor on Q801 and Q802.\nVOUT_BUF: guard ring around the sense nodes, supply of the level translator, monitor input.\nD801 clamps the terminal to ground and to about 6.2 V (5.6 V node plus one diode)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 137.16 0)
